        "original_id": "afb3f376-1434-5835-b702-191a68678f35",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sing Out for Ireland\n- Organizations: The Wolfe Tones\n- People: Theobald Wolfe Tone\n- Events: Irish Rebellion of 1798\n- Concepts: wolf tone\n\nFacts:\n- Theobald Wolfe Tone was one of the leaders of the Irish Rebellion of 1798.\n- The Wolfe Tones are an Irish folk and rebel band.\n- The Wolfe Tones took their name from the Irish rebel and patriot Theobald Wolfe Tone.\n- The Wolfe Tones' name also alludes to a \"wolf tone,\" which is a spurious sound that can affect instruments of the violin family.\n- Sing Out for Ireland is the fourteenth album by The Wolfe Tones.",
